# Note for AI Agents:
# Repository operating guidelines, active requests, TODOs, and bug tracking are maintained in AGENTS.md.
# Read AGENTS.md upon startup and keep it updated.

# AGENTS.local.md holds the REAL project journal (Active Requests / Known Bugs /
# TODOs, with real specifics) - split out from AGENTS.md so the committed AGENTS.md
# stays generic and shareable. Never committed.
AGENTS.local.md
ANTIGRAVITY_FEEDBACK.md
CLAUDE.md

